@ref s 59 (src:2413-2418)
GIVEN `the thing given to the workman by way of remuneration is noxious drugs or intoxicating liquor` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `s 59 Actor` `s 59 Action`
`s 59 the employer's prohibition on giving noxious drugs or intoxicating liquor` MEANS
