-- src:2424 | the sale of foodstuffs, provisions, meals or refreshments; but a
-- src:2425 | workman must not be compelled by any contract of service to
-- src:2426 | purchase any goods at that shop or canteen, and noxious drugs and
-- src:2427 | intoxicating liquor must not be sold at any such shop or canteen.
@ref s 60(1) (src:2422-2427)
GIVEN `the employer establishes or permits to be established a shop or a canteen for the sale of foodstuffs, provisions, meals or refreshments` IS A BOOLEAN
